### Health check
GET http://localhost:9095/

### Scrape single URL
POST http://localhost:9095/scraper/scrape
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://example.com",
  "options": {
    "waitForSelector": "body",
    "extractors": {
      "title": "h1",
      "description": "p"
    }
  }
}

### Scrape multiple URLs (batch)
POST http://localhost:9095/scraper/scrape-batch
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "urls": [
    "https://example.com/page1",
    "https://example.com/page2"
  ],
  "options": {
    "waitForSelector": "main",
    "extractors": {
      "title": "h1"
    }
  }
}

### Get all scraping jobs
GET http://localhost:9095/scraper/jobs?page=1&limit=10

### Get job by ID
GET http://localhost:9095/scraper/jobs/YOUR_JOB_ID_HERE

### Cancel job
DELETE http://localhost:9095/scraper/jobs/YOUR_JOB_ID_HERE

### Get all scraped data
GET http://localhost:9095/scraper/data?page=1&limit=10

### Get scraped data by ID
GET http://localhost:9095/scraper/data/YOUR_DATA_ID_HERE

### Get page pool statistics
GET http://localhost:9095/scraper/stats

### Scrape Caromoto without authentication
POST http://localhost:9095/scraper/scrape-caromoto
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://caromoto.com",
  "options": {
    "timeout": 60000
  }
}

